2026/02/18 16:52:38 PG Send: {"Type":"Parse","Name":"","Query":"-- ===========================================================================\r\n-- Migration Complete\r\n-- ===========================================================================\r\n-- \r\n-- What Changed:\r\n-- 1. [done] Backfilled profile.full_name for all 8 doctors\r\n-- 2. [done] Added profile -> doctor name sync trigger\r\n-- 3. [done] Added doctor -> profile name backfill trigger\r\n-- 4. [done] Verified sync status\r\n--\r\n-- Test:\r\n-- -- Update profile name\r\n-- UPDATE profiles SET full_name = 'Dr. Test Name' WHERE id = '\u003cprofile_id\u003e';\r\n-- -- Check doctor name updated\r\n-- SELECT name FROM doctors WHERE profile_id = '\u003cprofile_id\u003e';\r\n-- \r\n-- Expected: doctor.name = 'Dr. Test Name'\r\n-- ===========================================================================\r\n\r\n\r\n-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n-- Source: 20260122160000_auto_generate_username.sql\r\n-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n-- Migration: Auto-Generate Username from Email\r\n-- Description: Backfills missing usernames and auto-generates for new profiles\r\n-- [warning]  SAFETY: ONLY fills NULL/empty usernames - NEVER overwrites existing ones\r\n-- Pattern: username = email_prefix (before @) with conflict resolution\r\n\r\nBEGIN","ParameterOIDs":null}
